# Fuzzing (§E row 7): generated build outputs + working/evolved corpora. The
# fuzz source, seed inputs (fuzz/seeds/), and crash reproducers (fuzz/findings/)
# are tracked; the binaries, instrumented objects, and mutated corpora are not.
fuzz/.obj/
fuzz/fuzz_data
fuzz/fuzz_loader
fuzz/fuzz_image
fuzz/fuzz_sound
fuzz/fuzz_font
fuzz/corpus_*/
fuzz/crashes/
fuzz/logs/
fuzz/logs2/
# stray libFuzzer artifacts if a run is launched without -artifact_prefix
fuzz/oom-*
fuzz/crash-*
fuzz/slow-unit-*
fuzz/leak-*
fuzz/timeout-*
